# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/prefill-2 window (the device-side hand-off of the final step's GDN state; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/prefill-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-pf2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-pf2-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# C2_MODEL_REPO / C2_MODEL_REVISION (qwen_c2_checkpoint.py): a smoke job that carries them serves the Swift checkpoint (what production serves) from its own converted-weight directory; the keys are the same
# in every smoke job of this pack, so each pair differs by the profile alone. The prefix steps (AP1, R1, R2) do not forward the selection into their container and serve the base checkpoint: the hand-off moves
# the GDN state of a finished prefill, whose shape and bytes the checkpoint does not change.
# AP1 (EXACTNESS of the hand-off on RETURNING turns, STOP): c2_prefix_gate.py --plan tier-timed on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-pf2-s4-audit: the cold
# prefill, the device-resident hit and the host-tier restore at about 32k, 128k and 254k tokens, every final step of them audited (the first eight final steps all are). The
# returning turns are the production shape: a hit resumes on a 2,048-token boundary, its first step is a CHECKPOINT restore, its last a hand-off at 125k and 245k of
# context. READ: the plan verdict PASS (its own exactness reads: the returning answers equal the cold twins'); "[PINDIAG] prefill handoff audit n=<k> exact=True" for every
# final step it runs and NO "audit mismatch", NO "fell back". ANY failure is NO-GO for the lever. This step does not forward the Swift selection: it serves the base
# checkpoint. RUN WITH THE CI PAUSED. Duration (estimate): 90 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-pf2-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=tier-timed
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-pf2-s4-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_BOX_MINUTES=150
